Scoped Asterisk raw signed linear (SLN) demuxer semantics

The fixed pcm_s16le 8000 Hz mono stream parameters (sln_options defaults and
raw_codec_id), the extension-only detection and the read-to-EOF payload in
src/sln.ts follow libavformat/pcmdec.c (ff_sln_demuxer, sln_options,
pcm_read_header) and pcm.c (ff_pcm_read_packet, ff_pcm_default_packet_size,
ff_pcm_read_seek).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
